# apps/api/Dockerfile takes only the builds make build-api-image makes and the manifests
# its dependencies install from.
*
!package.json
!bun.lock
!apps/*/package.json
!packages/*/package.json
!apps/api/dist/
!apps/web/dist/client/
# Source maps go to Sentry only, never into the image (SDD 11章「Web のエラー」).
**/*.map
